            "review_title": "Review at Bun thit nuong",
            "review_text": "Jilliangio\nMarietta, Georgia67 contributions\n0\nCheap, delicious lunch\nMay 2019 • Couples\nIn order to get the correct address of this place, search it on Google Maps. \n\nThe folks here were super friendly, we came at the end of their lunch rush (around 1) and they said they were closing for a couple hours, but then came back and said they could accommodate us. They only had enough for 2 bun thit nuong, but even so it was great. Serviced with pleasant cold tea too. \n\nHighly recommend. Just either go before 1pm or after 3-4pm\nRead more\nWritten May 20, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
