            "review_text": "Steve Ballard\nMontville, Australia66 contributions\n0\nMy favourite place to eat in Quy Nhon\nFeb 2017 • Solo\nThis is a great place to eat, but you do need to know what you are doing when it comes to ordering, as you need at least limited Vietnamese, but that's fine, I've never had any problems....and there is the slight problem of the different address, but the food is great at both places anyway....I just have some rice dishes at the first address, and then head over to the other place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 24, 2017",
