            "review_text": "Bex C\nExeter, United Kingdom7 contributions\n1\nGreat place but Wrong address!\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nThe address listed here is called bun that nuong, however now they only do Com (rice dishes) they directed us to their second restaurant at 120 Nguyen Thai hoc. This is where you can get the rice paper wraps, cold noodle dishes and rice amougst other dishes which are amazing. Very fresh generous servings and very cheap.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 12, 2017",
