            "review_text": "Digdug79\nLeicester, United Kingdom14 contributions\n1\nBeware - closes really early!!\nMay 2016 • Couples\nDecided to eat here after seeing all the positive reviews on Tripadvisor. Got a taxi and arrived just after 8pm. The place was already closing for the night and turned us away! We already knew a lot of restaurants in Quy Nhon close quite early, but 8pm was a shock even for us! None of the staff spoke any English at all, so it seems you're not guaranteed the 'English-speaking owner' to help you with your order, either. What a disappointment.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 4, 2016",
