            "review_title": "Review at Bun thit nuong",
            "review_text": "Max274967\nPerth, Australia191 contributions\n0\nI have lived in tis country and this is by far the tastiest and authentic food I have had here!\nMay 2015 • Couples\nWho ever wrote on here that it was \"expensive\" should return to the western world and realize how far ones $$ goes there!! I mean really!... My wife and I returned tonight for the 3rd night in a row to this wonderful eating room full of very friendly local people with a ready smile for us! If one was to go to a fish and chip shop in the UK you would get a bag of greasy chips for what here you would get a beer each, two large and fresh spring rolls and a bowl of noddles with so much in it (Chicken , pork, peanuts and vegtables etc...), it is flavorsome to say the least! All for under 100.000 VD (Under 6.00 Aud!) There may be cheaper around but the food there surely can not be beaten on flavour or freshness! I would totally recommend this restaurant to any one who is lucky enough to visit one of Vietnams last remaining underdeveloped and non touristic destinations on the main route north south or visa versa! Try it .......It will not dissapoint you! Best food ever in this amazing country which I believe is the best that Asia has to offer now!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 15, 2015",
