            "review_text": "Emily W\nCalgary, Canada42 contributions\n0\nAmazing local experience with great food\nJan 2015 • Couples\nThis was our favourite place in Quy Nhon! We ate here twice a day for the three days we were here. They have a small menu but everything is very good. The most expensive dish was 25,000 dong. The service was spot on and they spoke English well!\n\nAs long as you don't mind sitting on plastic stools you will enjoy it! There were always lots of locals which made it a great cultural experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 30, 2015",
